The design system's fonts, as the web kit bundles them (frontend/src/kit/fonts.ts):
Figtree 400, 400 italic, 500 and 600, and Bricolage Grotesque 600 and 700, from
@fontsource/figtree 5.3.0 and @fontsource/bricolage-grotesque 5.3.0.

Each file merges the Unicode subsets the web bundles for that face (Figtree: latin and
latin-ext; Bricolage Grotesque: latin, latin-ext and vietnamese) into one TTF, because GPUI
takes TTF, with the family name set so GPUI finds it. Text in any other script falls back to
the system's fonts. Built by native/tools/fonts/build_fonts.py (fonttools 4.60.1, run once in
a throwaway python:3.13-slim container; the files are committed).

